{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_03_title", "source_sha256": "28a9cc68df43a392845d0643f6c2de35472b86c80107c8dfeaf6cafe27c42ccd", "ja": "14thLIVE Come Know Me 留守電", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "dd79fd70e128d08be968ff447c3ad180d92fa65b5c8ddc426607786924c270a6", "ja": "14thLIVE DAY2『Blooming Sign\nCome Know Me』を無事に終えた\nこのみからの留守番電話です。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_03_1000_039kon", "source_sha256": "c58d66ce2d8b5dbfbae1b5f530468f285a6a5892a2cbf5637c8e78e3c6984ac6", "ja": "もしもし、{$P$}？\nお疲れさま。急にごめんなさい。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_03_1001_039kon", "source_sha256": "2c87f88906af76799943e7e79186b6ea4822947604e40ba31c18a7cb749278d3", "ja": "公演が終わってホッとしちゃったら、\nなんだか電話したくなっちゃって……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_03_1002_039kon", "source_sha256": "2a402e0820370540a3d37844c6f06fdc6ac84644defe09095b688081287dd664", "ja": "まぁ、早く気持ちを伝えたくて、\n我慢できなかっただけなんだけどね。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_03_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "a3a86d140f9a9b99fbfdda19c826bb6e0bae91d944ae6c69548e5ee4786e0915", "ja": "まずは……{$P$}、私を主演公演の\nステージに立たせてくれて、ありがとう！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_03_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "6256f07dbc518066e016171fa1003105dcca32aa926b13be26c9db3a4bcbdb78", "ja": "アイドルになってから、\nいろんなことがあったけど……", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_03_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "d5338977cf4f4a0646202568e722aa803f937a87f3f587ae5b54ad5bca9aa2eb", "ja": "今日のステージは、一つの集大成って感じだったわね。\n私もアイドルとしての箔が付いたかしら？　ウフフ♪", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_03_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "878ce123b766404c95502f1e1a01afe21f5f4a216da74cad035d921c4dda9750", "ja": "そう……。本当にびっくりよね。\nまさか私が、主演公演に……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_03_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "9e809868218ecc33598f8c21469115f25d5dfbd631d25280eac6e349582024ce", "ja": "あんなに眩しい所に、立たせてもらえるなんて……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_03_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "3290995046bfdb71d2e12ffe16235f46388a868d1b6dd7b12a2ab4e068edf667", "ja": "あの日、貴方に出会って……劇場のみんなに出会って。\nアイドルになって……良かった。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_03_1009_039kon", "source_sha256": "7cfcf627642676832da134cae20940ac13e9d0f1331ce862535e2f0381d8afeb", "ja": "だから、あらためてお礼を言わせてちょうだい。\n……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_03_1010_039kon", "source_sha256": "a35a6c5537c040b6dc7fcbf6c163a4365b3e67894272aec9ac07a0a3ce8e246c", "ja": "ずっと一緒に歩いてきてくれて……。\nありがとう、{$P$}。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_03_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "704853783c6f510ecb90e30a88ac862040b2cc68d337b1657c3c8a91a06ae149", "ja": "でも、私たちはまだ、歩いている途中よね！\n明日からも、新しいステージが待っているんだもの。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_03_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "74e12db6cbf5b5f8b258559d6d360de0380e96edf04c4d630d57b79e5705f664", "ja": "だから……これからも、また一緒に。\nよろしくお願いします♪", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_03_1013_039kon", "source_sha256": "a450b53a8e673c3d01317666f7c49a3fff5cc2f211dce9be1310e0ee6522e8ea", "ja": "……フフッ、というわけで！\nこれからを頑張る元気の源といえば、打ち上げよね！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_03_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "5cda320c9830aefb5bddf592a6878464922ddeca027fec6a11b03e926c8d19a1", "ja": "莉緒ちゃんと一緒に待ってるんだけど、まだ来られ\nない？　もちろん忙しいのもわかってるけど……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_528_rs_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_528_rs_03_1015_039kon", "source_sha256": "ec80d3e8edc8a528d2d2588094b178fb936f4175c700036c25f08234dbb3f12f", "ja": "あんまりお姉さんを待たせちゃダメよ♪　ウフフ♪", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
